OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dreary day, being overcast
OL,6,Fwith spells of light rain for many.
OL,7,FBright or sunny spells will be focused
OL,8,Fin the west or southwest. Feeling
OL,9,Fchilly with a light, cool breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDrying up, though rain may
OL,12,Flinger for a time in the north. A calm
OL,13,Fand cold night, especially under clear
OL,14,Fspells where frost may develop before
OL,15,Fdawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA cold morning, maybe
OL,18,Ffrosty. Then, a chilly day with lots
OL,19,Fof cloud, and some showers focused in
OL,20,Fthe north. Spells of autumnal sunshine
OL,21,Fin the south and southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
