OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFoggy
OL,6,Fand frosty mornings for Sunday and
OL,7,FMonday, then becoming crisp and sunny
OL,8,Fautumn days. Becoming cloudy on Monday
OL,9,Fevening ahead of overnight rain.
OL,10,FMilder, wetter and windier on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
